From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:32:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 26/78] Port View Character: character choice, sheet menu and
 screen redraw

Port H065+$196E View Character (menu Items/Spells/Trade/Drop/Heal/Cure/
Exit built from what the character has), H065+$3702 Pick Character with
$3390 (previous/next party member), $36A6/$36C0 (always 0), and
H063+$321A (redraw the screen for the game mode, case 0 is the menu
frame). Items ($255A), Trade ($12D6) and Drop ($1636) stay stubs.
Fix the H042+$0254/$0B80 stub signatures to match the assembly.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013G8KST8dgGfenpqx3RukYi
